^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ B's overrider: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ A's own in C's A: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ D's x in both X: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ copy keeps both A subobjects: SUCCESS$
